![Club Nintendo](cover.png)

I want to share the course that started my interest in computers.
The HTML course from the Club Nintendo magazine. I found the scans of the
Mexican version, although I read the Chilean edition. The content is the same.

## First Part


<https://archive.org/embed/club-nintendo-ano-06-no-05-mexico>

Page 44. Introduction to HTML.
Basic tags like `<h1>`, `<img>` and hexadecimal colors. Tables and lists.

